1
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,070
Meet NOIR BARBER CLUB —

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:06,950
a premium website where customers can explore services,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,350
prices, the gallery, and everything the barbershop offers.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,980
Beautifully designed for both desktop and mobile.

5
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:16,650
Behind the website,

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:21,220
the owner has a dedicated dashboard to manage the entire business —

7
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:24,680
appointments, customers, staff,

8
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:28,820
services, prices, and business performance.

9
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:31,710
Everything is organized in one place.

10
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:35,210
Every barber has a personal account and dashboard.

11
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,700
They can check their assigned appointments,

12
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:40,270
view customer and service details,

13
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,760
view their schedule,

14
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:44,450
and update appointment statuses.

15
00:00:44,492 --> 00:00:46,762
Customers can create their own account,

16
00:00:46,812 --> 00:00:48,402
verify their email,

17
00:00:48,452 --> 00:00:49,552
and log in.

18
00:00:49,602 --> 00:00:51,282
They can explore services,

19
00:00:51,332 --> 00:00:52,822
choose their preferred barber,

20
00:00:52,872 --> 00:00:54,972
select an available date and time,

21
00:00:55,022 --> 00:00:56,722
and confirm their appointment.

22
00:00:56,772 --> 00:01:00,539
They can also manage their bookings directly from their phone.

23
00:01:00,879 --> 00:01:02,859
NOIR BARBER CLUB.

24
00:01:02,909 --> 00:01:06,349
One platform. Three experiences.

25
00:01:06,399 --> 00:01:08,459
Complete control.
